Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|layout.parallel.render.enable=false|
		|extraapps.plugins.includes|content-targeting|
		|ignore.errors|IX_DC6100CC|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|false|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.component.names|Content Targeting|
		|testray.main.component.name|Content Targeting|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When Portlet shutdown Server
	And Portlet start Server
	And User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	Then Page add
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Smoke
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|content.targeting.release|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment add CP
		|userSegmentDescription|User Segment Description|
		|userSegmentName|User Segment Name|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment add System Attributes Browser Rule CP
		|browserName|Firefox|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add CP
		|campaignDescription|Campaign Description|
		|campaignEndDate|1/1/2099|
		|campaignEndTime|12:00 PM|
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|campaignPriorityField|3|
		|campaignStartDate|1/1/2015|
		|campaignStartTime|12:00 AM|
		|userSegmentSelect|User Segment Name|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign view Campaign CP
		|campaignDescription|Campaign Description|
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|campaignPriority|3|
		|campaignStatus|Started|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add With Category CP
		|categoryName|User Segment Name|
		|vocabularyName|User Segment|
		|webContentContent|WC User Segment Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC User Segment Title|
	And WebContent view Title
		|webContentTitle|WC User Segment Title|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add With Category CP
		|categoryName|User Segment Name|
		|vocabularyName|User Segment|
		|webContentContent|WC Campaign Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC Campaign Title|
	And WebContent view Title
		|webContentTitle|WC User Segment Title|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign goto Add Report
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add Report Name
		|reportDescription|Custom Report Description|
		|reportName|Custom Report Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add Tracking Action Content CP
		|contentMetricName|Content Metric Name|
		|contentTitle|WC Campaign Title|
		|contentTrackingActionSelect|View|
		|menulistContent|Basic Web Content|
	And PortletEntry save
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Campaign Content Display|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|User Segment Content Display|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|User Segment Content List|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|User Segment Content Display|
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And UserSegmentContentDisplayPortlet configure Display Content
		|belongs|true|
		|contentTitle|WC User Segment Title|
		|contentType|Basic Web Content|
		|rowNumber|1|
		|toAll|true|
		|userSegmentName|User Segment Name|
	And UserSegmentContentDisplayPortlet save PG
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|Campaign Content Display|
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And CampaignDisplayPortlet configure Campaign Rule
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|contentTitle|WC Campaign Title|
		|contentType|Basic Web Content|
		|rowNumber|1|
	And CampaignDisplayPortlet save PG
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And CampaignDisplayPortlet view PG
		|entryContentText|WC Campaign Content|
		|previewCampaignList|Campaign Name,default|
		|viewCampaignSelected|Campaign Name|
		|viewDontDisplay|true|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And UserSegmentContentDisplayPortlet view Entry PG
		|entryContentText|WC User Segment Content|
		|previewUserSegmentList|User Segment Name,default|
		|viewDontDisplay|true|
		|viewUserSegmentSelected|User Segment Name|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And UserSegmentContentListPortlet view Content
		|viewEntryContentList|WC Campaign Content,WC User Segment Content|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign update Report
